WEBVTT

00:08:29.459 --> 00:08:32.378
It has just the right value

00:08:32.378 --> 00:08:35.071
to keep the universe hanging

00:08:35.071 --> 00:08:37.641
in an unstable situation.

00:08:37.641 --> 00:08:40.897
The Higgs field is in a wobbly configuration

00:08:40.897 --> 00:08:42.946
that has lasted so far

00:08:42.946 --> 00:08:45.991
but that will eventually collapse.

00:08:45.991 --> 00:08:49.170
So according to these calculations,

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.200
we are like campers

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:53.652
who accidentally set their tent

00:08:53.652 --> 00:08:55.446
at the edge of a cliff.

00:08:55.446 --> 00:08:57.236
And eventually, the Higgs field

00:08:57.236 --> 00:08:59.172
will undergo a phase transition

00:08:59.172 --> 00:09:02.216
and matter will collapse into itself.